        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Zion ching le kauh gaanchuanga,",
            "Pouh rui akhang kasiamh;",
            "Khou tei ai guang tanghpui nung rui,",
            "Neihla mei mun lani.",
            "",
            "Khou tei guang tangh khang nkhuan bam e,",
            "Zeipaan rui liulou mei Zion ram;",
            "He! Tabui nung rui hou nina cho?",
            "Poubaomei ram neih keidat makpui ram.",
            "",
            "2. Jordan duipaeng khou rianra na,",
            "Pouh ta nkhuan bam e;",
            "Gaanchua’nga paeng thang ram gaimei,",
            "Tabui nung hou nicho.",
            "",
            "3. ‘Tao tat dikho Zion na guay,",
            "Kanaan ram gai thang tei;",
            "Ai lunghpui ram zinghpui bam hei,",
            "Mpat lou khap ni the.",
            "",
            "4. Rih khou tanhmei Immanuel,",
            "Mi ram tei tangpu khou;",
            "Nzianmei pheiban tei baanna,",
            "Tingsaeng zaengthaek bamni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
